{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38164","headline":"隰州新驿赠刺史 · 韩偓","name":"隰州新驿赠刺史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤侯新换古长亭，先定心机指顾成。\n高义尽招秦逐客，旷怀偏接鲁诸生。\n萍蓬到此销离恨，燕雀飞来带喜声。\n却笑昔贤交易极，一开东合便垂名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}